Firefox is already running If you try to open Firefox and get the message “Firefox is already running”, close all Firefox windows and try this script. It removes the leftover lock files:
#!/bin/bash find ~/.mozilla -name &#34;*lock&#34; -print0 | while IFS= read -r -d &#39;&#39; file; do echo &#34;removing $file...&#34; rm &#34;$file&#34; done

